leader, Tiseth the Thrall.\n\n---\n\nKill fetid fiends in the name of Cazic Thule 0/6 (Fear Itself)\nKill shiverbacks in the name of Cazic Thule 0/2 (Fear Itself)\nKill phoboplasms in the name of Cazic Thule 0/2 (Fear Itself)\nCollect skeletal remains 0/4 (Fear Itself)\n_This is a common drop off the above mobs._\nGive the remains to Alezra 0/1 (Fear Itself)\nSpeak to Alezra 0/1 (Fear Itself)\nYou say, 'Hail, Alezra D`Vour'\nAlezra D`Vour says 'Under the fearful gaze of Cazic Thule, I curse these remains so that those who gaze upon them will feel the terror and fear of a God. Let them serve as an offering, placed in Cazic's temple by an initiate of Thule, bathed in the blood of Fear.'\nBathe yourself in blood 0/1 (Fear Itself)\n_There is a room in the lower floors of the temple with a pool of blood (location is 795, 410, 75). Stand in the blood for a few moments for the update._\nPlace the remains in the temple as an offering 0/1 (Fear Itself)\nget on top of the table and CLICK the Bones\n_Go to the top floor of the temple and place the remains on the altar in the northeastern-most room of the floor._\nPresent yourself to Tiseth the Thrall 0/1 (Fear Itself)\n_Tiseth the Thrall is found at the very top of the temple (can only get to him from the outside, by using the ramp on the eastern side of the temple)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Tiseth the Thrall'\nTiseth the Thrall says 'Never before have I encountered an initiate who has shown such an affinity for fear. I believe with your pledge, we will be able to seek out Cazic Thule himself, and be welcomed into his fearful embrace!'\nYou completed the scared ritual by standing before Tiseth the Thrall, and were found to be worthy of Cazic's presence.\n_Rewards:_\n158 platinum\nExperience\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n15 Dream Motes\n_This leads into the group mission for Fear Itself, \"An Offering to Thule\"._\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
