      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Fear Itself [zone=756]\n**Who:**\n- Reena Kedson [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Jaris' Spellbook [item=93819]\n- Sherri's Equipment [item=93817]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Jaris Calmur [npc=36672]\n- Sharuleth [npc=36682]\n- Sherri Ganes [npc=36673]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Reena #2: Terror Personified [quest=5252]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Dec 2 22:44:44 2010\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This is the first of two tasks that begin with Reena Kedson ( map) in Fear Itself. She's located on the hill outside the amygdalan temple (within the ring of fire) at 665, 185._\nYou say, 'Hail, Reena Kedson'\nReena Kedson says 'You there! You aren't a vile looking creature, or an insane iksar. You'll do. My friends and I need some [help] here.'\nYou say, 'Help?'\nReena Kedson says 'That's right. We have some serious problems. One of those amygdalans that serves Cazic Thule runs that temple with an iron fist. Its name is [Sharuleth]. After we deal with that creature, we still have to find a proper escape route. We'll need to deal with [Tiseth] when it comes to that.'\nYou say, 'What about Tiseth?'\nReena Kedson says 'Hm, well we can't deal with Tiseth yet. We'll need to deal with [Sharuleth] first.'\nYou say, 'Sharuleth, then?'\nReena Kedson says 'I've seen some horrible monsters in my days, but this thing is the true embodient of the word. If you'd like to help us rid this Plane of this creature, we'd appreciate it. What do you say? Are you ready to [fight]?'\nYou say, 'Ready to fight!'\nReena Kedson says 'Good. First, speak to my comrades already in the temple. Use the front entrance on the side there. They won't be too deep in.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Foundation of Fear'.\nInfiltrate the temple of Cazic Thule and assist Reena's allies in clearing out the creatures and amygdalans who inhabit it by recovering their equipment.\n_NOTE: The following points for your \"thuledream.txt\" map file will be of use for these two tasks:_\nP -185.0000, -675.0000, 65.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Reena\\_Kedson\nP -440.0000, -900.0000, 115.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Jaris\\_and\\_Sherri\nP -410.0000, -860.0000, 115.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Equipment\nP -520.0000, -830.0000, 35.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Equipment\nP -355.0000, -690.0000, 50.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Equipment\nP -470.0000, -700.0000, 50.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Spellbook\nP -435.0000, -915.0000, 50.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Sharuleth\nP -400.0000, -905.0000, 50.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Shade\nP -425.0000, -810.0000, 215.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Tiseth\\_the\\_Thrall\n_In-game /locs:_\nReena:\n675, 185, 65 _(on hill outside temple)_\nJaris & Sherri:\n900, 440, 115 _(inside temple; second floor down from top)_\nEquipment Spawns:\n860, 410, 115\n830, 520, 35\n690, 355, 50\nBook Spawn:\n700, 470, 50 _(inside temple; a few floors down from top)_\nSharuleth & Shade:\n915, 435, 50 _(very bottom of the temple)_\nTiseth the Thrall:\n810, 425, 215 _(top of the temple)_\n\n---\n\nSpeak to Sherri Ganes inside the temple 0/1 (Fear Itself)\n_Sherri and Jaris are found on the second level from the top of the temple. They're in one of the first rooms._\nYou say, 'Hail, Sherri Ganes'\nSherri Ganes says 'I lost a lot of gear on our movement down deeper into this temple. We're a bit outmatched, and glad you're here to help. Can you get the lost equipment? We'll need it if we are going to leave the Plane of Fear. You should be able to find it scattered around, or some of the amygdalans might have picked some up.'\nSpeak to Jaris Calmur inside the temple 0/1 (Fear Itself)\nYou say, 'Hail, Jaris Calmur'\nJaris Calmur says 'I need you to find my spellbook. I lost it after we made it deeper into the temple, and now I can't seem to get back down. Nevermind dealing with these amygdalans. Can I count on your aid?'\nReturn Sherri's equipment 0/3 (Fear Itself)\nGive Jaris his spellbook 0/1 (Fear Itself)\nSpeak to Reena Kedson 0/1 (Fear Itself)\nYou say, 'Hail, Reena Kedson'\nReena Kedson says 'You're back. Thanks to your work, my friends are now back to full strength. There is an amygdalan shadowknight named Sharuleth who is guarding the secrets to the Plane of Fear. It is a well-favored creature of Cazic Thule's, and we must defeat it. Unfortunately, I don't think we're in any condition to do so. We'll hold the amygdalans back while you go in for the kill. We're counting on you.'\nDestroy Sharuleth deep inside the temple 0/1 (Fear Itself)\n_Sharuleth is found on the bottom floor of the temple in a room with a few other amygdalans. He hits for a max ~7,600._\nSharuleth has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nSharuleth's corpse gasps for air, choking out one final breath.\nReturn to Reena Kedson 0/1 (Fear Itself)\nYou say, 'Hail, Reena Kedson'\nReena Kedson says 'I can feel that his oppressive aura is gone already. I must admit, I could never keep up with you. I managed to get some information from a crazed Cazic Thule follower that has met with [Tiseth]. We'll have to deal with her next.'\nYou've defeated Sharuleth, an elite warrior of Cazic Thule and given Reena and her comrades an opportunity to find a way out of the Plane of Fear.\n_Rewards:_\n210 platinum (about 3 AAs)\nExperience\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n20 Dream Motes\n_The task \"Terror Personified\" follows this one._\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
