      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Fear Itself [zone=756]\n**Who:**\n- Reena Kedson [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 95\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Shard of Thule's Nightmare [item=94299]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Jaris Calmur [npc=36672]\n- Shade of Cazic Thule [npc=36683]\n- Sherri Ganes [npc=36673]\n- Tiseth the Thrall [npc=36667]\n- an amygdalan knight [npc=36617]\n- an amygdalan warrior [npc=36616]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Reena #1: Foundation of Fear [quest=5251]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Dec 2 22:45:25 2010\nModified: Thu Feb 16 09:36:48 2012 | | _This is the second of two tasks that begin with Reena Kedson in Fear Itself. She's located on the hill outside the amygdalan temple (within the ring of fire)._\n_You must have completed the task \"Foundation of Fear\" in order to request this one._\n_At the end of the previous task:_\nReena Kedson says 'I can feel that his oppressive aura is gone already. I must admit, I could never keep up with you. I managed to get some information from a crazed Cazic Thule follower that has met with [Tiseth]. We'll have to deal with her next.'\nYou say, 'So, about Tiseth...'\nReena Kedson says 'She's a crazed worshipper of Cazic Thule. She's too delusional to be dangerous, but she appears to have snatched up some [artifact] that has a resonance with this Plane. I'm not exactly sure I understsand how it works, but Jaris can explain it. He thinks we can escape if we get it. Can you help us get this [artifact]?'\nYou say, 'I'll get the artifact'\nReena Kedson says 'I'm glad to hear it. I'll need you to speak to Sherri and Jaris first. You'll find them inside the temple. Use the front entrance.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Terror Personified'.\nGather the artifact requested to break the power of the amygdalans and allow Reena and the others trapped in this dream world to escape this nightmare.\n_NOTE: The following points for your \"thuledream.txt\" map file will be of use for these two tasks:_\nP -185.0000, -675.0000, 65.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Reena\\_Kedson\nP -440.0000, -900.0000, 115.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Jaris\\_and\\_Sherri\nP -410.0000, -860.0000, 115.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Equipment\nP -520.0000, -830.0000, 35.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Equipment\nP -355.0000, -690.0000, 50.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Equipment\nP -470.0000, -700.0000, 50.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Spellbook\nP -435.0000, -915.0000, 50.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Sharuleth\nP -400.0000, -905.0000, 50.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Shade\nP -425.0000, -810.0000, 215.0000, 0, 0, 0, 2, Tiseth\\_the\\_Thrall\n_In-game /locs:_\nReena:\n675, 185, 65 _(on hill outside temple)_\nJaris & Sherri:\n900, 440, 115 _(inside temple; second floor down from top)_\nEquipment Spawns:\n860, 410, 115\n830, 520, 35\n690, 355, 50\nBook Spawn:\n700, 470, 50 _(inside temple; a few floors down from top)_\nSharuleth & Shade:\n915, 435, 50 _(very bottom of the temple)_\nTiseth the Thrall:\n810, 425, 215 _(top of the temple)_\n\n---\n\nSpeak to Sherri Ganes inside the temple 0/1 (Fear Itself)\nYou say, 'Hail, Sherri Ganes'\nSherri Ganes says 'That lunatic iskar, Tiseth the Thrall, boasts that she can get out of here. She has some sort of artifact that is strengthening the Plane of Fear's denziens. I'd love to go have a word with her, but I'm afraid we'll need your help. It's all I can do to keep these amygdalans at bay.'\nSpeak to Jaris Calmur inside the temple 0/1 (Fear Itself)\nYou say, 'Hail, Jaris Calmur'\nJaris Calmur says 'There is a dark force deep inside this temple, and I'm afraid Tiseth's artifact is the key to defeating it for good. When I killed it, it just came back to life. You should be able to confront her to get the artifact. Once you do, you'll need to destroy the shade of Cazic Thule that resides here.'\nDefeat amygdalan warriors 0/3 (Fear Itself)\nDefeat amygdalan knights 0/3 (Fear Itself)\nInterrogate Tiseth the Thrall, take the Shard, and hold onto it 0/1 (Fear Itself)\n_Task Window Says:_ Interrogate Tiseth the Thrall and steal her artifact before she can do anymore damage.\n_Tiseth is found at the top of the temple._\nYou say, 'Hail, Tiseth the Thrall'\nTiseth the Thrall says 'Stay back! The Shard of Thule's Nightmare is mine! I refuse to let this paradise end! What are you doing? Unhand me! Give me that back! The master's shade cannot be destroyed so easily, even if you steal my shard!'\n_You receive a Shard of Thule's Nightmare on your cursor._\nDefeat the Shade of Cazic Thule 0/1 (Fear Itself)\n_Task Window Says:_ Steal the artifact. With the shard in your possession, you should be able to destroy the Shade of Cazic Thule inside the temple permanently.\n_The Shade of Cazic Thule spawns at the very bottom of the temple._\n_It's a Shadow Knight, hits for a max ~7,600, has a lot of hitpoints, and has a very fast respawn (within a minute or two)._\nShade of Cazic Thule has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nShade of Cazic Thule's corpse gasps for air, choking out one final breath.\nGive the Shard of Thule's Nightmare to Reena 0/1 (Fear Itself)\nSpeak with Reena 0/1 (Fear Itself)\n_Task Window Says:_ The shard you took from Tiseth has lost much of its luster. You should talk to Reena about it and give her the shard.\nYou say, 'Hail, Reena Kedson'\nReena Kedson says 'Excellent work! By destroying that echo of Cazic Thule, this shard you gave me has lost most of its power. I think we can destroy it completely. I don't know for certain if it will allow us to escape, but it should weaken the dark forces at work in this Plane. Which, I'm beginning to think, isn't the real Plane of Fear.'\nYou've destroyed the shard of Cazic Thule and have made this image of the Plane of Fear safer. Even if Reena and her friends cannot find a way out of this dream, their time trapped will be less dangerous.\n_Rewards:_\n210 platinum (about 3 AAs)\nExperience\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n20 Dream Motes\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
