      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Fear Itself [zone=756]\n**Who:**\n- Arki Battlehammer [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Related Creatures:**\n- an amygdalan knight [npc=36617]\n- an amygdalan warrior [npc=36616]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Dec 4 00:14:27 2010\nModified: Sat Dec 4 00:19:29 2010 | | _This is a solo kill task that begins with Arki Battlehammer in Fear Itself. He is in an NPC camp right next to the zone-in area._\nYou say, 'Hail, Arki Battlehammer'\nArki Battlehammer says 'Oh, Brell protect us! It's a slaughter out there. The [threat] is so great. I've never seen it quite this bad in Fear.'\nYou say, 'What threat?'\nArki Battlehammer says 'They're putting up quite a fight today, and Cazic's bloodthirsty slaughter of mortals just [empowers them].'\nYou say, 'Empowers them?'\nArki Battlehammer says 'I mean pretty much anyone native to this plane. I suppose the biggest threat against my fellowship has been the [Amygdalans] and [fetid fiends].'\nYou say, 'What about the Amygdalans?'\nArki Battlehammer says 'The Amygdalans took down a few of our friends, and it took all the priests could muster to save the rest of us. If you wish to [take down] several of them, we may be able to go in and search for the bodies of our fallen groupmates.'\nYou say, 'I'll take down the Amygdalans'\nArki Battlehammer says 'Your assistance is greatly appreciated, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Corpse Camped'.\nArki Battlehammer feels the Amygdalans have cut down many of their forces and requests your assistance in taking them down.\n\n---\n\nKill several amygdalan knights 0/4 (Fear Itself)\nKill several amygdalan warriors 0/4 (Fear Itself)\n_You'll find some amygdalans wandering about the ring of fire and around the small temples in the zone, but most are located in the large temple in the middle of the ring of fire._\nReport back to Arki 0/1 (Fear Itself)\nYou say, 'Hail, Arki Battlehammer'\nArki Battlehammer gives a nod of his head at your report, then bows his head for the loss of his comrades.\n_Rewards:_\nExperience (about 1 AA worth)\nMinor faction with Dream Delvers",
