      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Fear Itself [zone=756]\n**Who:**\n- Rashan Spiritweaver [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +5\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Spinechiller Venom [item=93678]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a spinechiller spider [npc=36622]\n- a spinechiller widow [npc=36619]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Dec 4 00:14:35 2010\nModified: Sun Aug 8 14:41:48 2021 | | _This is a solo kill task that begins with Rashan Spiritweaver in Fear Itself. He is in an NPC camp right next to the zone-in area._\nYou say, 'Hail, Rashan Spiritweaver'\nRashan Spiritweaver seems to be lost in a chant as he leans over the faintly breathing woman before him. A seasoned adventurer would recognize his incantations as being an attempt to cleanse [poison].\nYou say, 'What kind of poison did this?'\nRashan Spiritweaver stops as he's awoken from his trance and looks up at \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. 'Spider venom, specifically. She took ill from the venom of the spinechillers. It keeps [transforming] and moving.' He lowers his head.\nYou say, 'Transforming?'\nRashan Spiritweaver closes his eyes from the pain, but a tear soaks the fur beneath them. 'On entry into her system, the venom keeps morphing, making it difficult to treat. Just as I think I have saved her, it appears it has merely changed constitution.' He looks back up at \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_ and inquires, 'The only hope for her are pure samples of the venom that has infected her, those that have not yet been injected in flesh. I could study it and try to find a way to stop the transformations or anticipate the next forms. It's a lot to ask with how dire the situation is here, but would you [retrieve some] to save her?'\nYou say, 'I will retrieve some'\nRashan Spiritweaver places a hand on your arm and nods. 'Thank you... May your ancestors guide you, friend. Return safe.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Antidote Within'.\nA transforming poison was found to be slowly tearing apart Iyana T`vre and Rashan Spiritweaver has been doing all he can to help her as she suffers. However, what he cannot do while he tends to her is obtain some samples of pre-injection venom from the spinechiller spiders to examine them more completely. He has asked for you to do so in his place.\n\n---\n\nKill several spinechiller spiders and widows and search their corpses 0/4 (Fear Itself)\nLoot a few spinechiller venom samples 0/4 (Fear Itself)\n_Spinechiller spiders roam most parts of the zone, but seem to be most common in the southern half. Their venom is a common drop._\n_Note: These are not pre-lootable._\nReturn the samples to Rashan 0/1 (Fear Itself)\nRashan Spiritweaver says, 'You couldn't have come a moment too soon. Every moment without the antidote, is a moment closer to her death. I'll get started looking at these samples immediately. Thank you.'\n\n---\n\n_Rewards:_\nExperience (about 1 AA worth)\nMinor faction with Dream Delvers",
