      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Fear Itself [zone=756]\n**Who:**\n- Hildran Heartguard [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 90\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Dream Delvers +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a frightfinger [npc=36627]\n- a scareling [npc=36681]\n- an enraged frightfinger [npc=36650]\n- an enraged scareling [npc=36649]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Dec 5 00:01:17 2010\nModified: Sun Dec 5 00:07:11 2010 | | _This is a solo kill task that begins with Hildran Heartguard in Fear Itself. He is found in an NPC camp on the eastern zone boundary in the northeast part of the zone._\nYou say, 'Hail, Hildran Heartguard'\nHildran Heartguard says 'For once, I'm truly [scared], \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. What is going on here?'\nYou say, 'Why are you scared?'\nHildran Heartguard says 'The place of Fear is terrorizing today. We've been here before, fought many times against the beings here, but I'm not quite sure how we're in the position we are today. We've lost many friends on the battlefield, including our cleric, and it may be looking like a complete loss. The [undead] have been insistant on taking our camp, leaving us trying to fend them off when we can. Of course, there is also my personal [phobias] begining to play out here, causing an unwary grip on my sword. I had to switch to my two-hander for the sake of stability.'\nYou say, 'Phobias?'\nHildran Heartguard says 'I'm not normally easily frightened, even in the grips of Fear, but this appears to be over the top. The monstrocities are causing me to not be able to function as easily as the warrior of our band. If you could [take care of them], I might have a fighting chance.'\nYou say, 'I'll take care of them'\nHildran Heartguard says 'You're a life saver. Literally. Be safe out there. I'll be waiting.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Frozen in Fear'.\nHildran Heartguard isn't afraid of much, but it appears Fear Itself has reared its ugly head. He's asked for you to take care of what frightens him, so that he can be a better functioning warrior for his camp.\n\n---\n\nKill several frightfingers 0/4 (Fear Itself)\nKill a few scarelings 0/3 (Fear Itself)\nHail Hildran Heartguard and tell him it's fine 0/1 (Fear Itself)\nYou say, 'Hail, Hildran Heartguard'\nA little more sure of himself, Hildran Heartguard hoists his sword into the air, letting out a triumphant bellow. He gives his thanks, then prepares for the next battle.\n_Rewards:_\nExperience (about 1 AA worth)\nMinor faction with Dream Delvers",
