really appreciate your help. Tunare bless you.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'In Fear of Death'.\nUndead have been terrorizing Morae Windwatcher's fellowship, and she's asked that you slay them for the sake of her group.\n\n---\n\nTake down a number of boogeymen 0/4 (Fear Itself)\nTake down a number of samhain 0/4 (Fear Itself)\nTake down a number of phantasms 0/4 (Fear Itself)\nReturn to Morae to tell her of your deeds 0/1 (Fear Itself)\nYou say, 'Hail, Morae Windwatcher'\nMorae Windwatcher gives a faint but thankful smile at your report. 'You've been such a great help. Bless you.'\n_Rewards:_\nExperience (about 1 AA worth)\nMinor faction with Dream Delvers",
